    "spiritual": "This month, your spiritual growth may feel supported by a balance of discipline and ease. You may notice your ability to return to calm quickly, even when life brings sudden stress. At times, moods may rise and fall, yet they may not disturb your inner stability for long. Reflection may feel more rewarding, offering practical insights you can use in daily life. Your journey may show steadiness, even if not free from small interruptions. To deepen this, experiment with reflective writing after moments of stress to see what you learned. Also, close each day with one line of affirmation that connects you to peace. These practices may keep your journey fresh and strong.",
    "remedyIntro": "For This Month From 01 August 2026 to 31 August 2026, endurance and humility will guide your actions, giving you the strength to handle duties with steadiness. Through mindful discipline, you can overcome burdens, stay balanced, and invite lasting peace.",
